{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026PF3kqiyHxE1793744137.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>九龍灣麗晶花園在凌晨有單位起火，兩人受傷送院，約兩百人疏散。</p><p></p><p>起火單位冒出濃煙，消防員射水灌救。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.KLB-0500_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026fph0aRTvXY1793744135.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.KLB-0500_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026P7HgMQ0yVN1793744130.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>凌晨三時許，警方接報指麗晶花園22座有低層單位起火，消防員到場迅速將火救熄。單位63歲男住客手腳受傷，在救護車接受初步治理，同一單位35歲女住客，吸入濃煙不適，兩人送院。約200名居民疏散到安全地方。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.FIRE.KLB-0500_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026UQwtwIkCeU1793744128.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>消防調查後，相信單位有插蘇過熱引致火警。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T00:44:44.993670+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T23:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T05:38:39.897230+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T00:38:22.714196+00:00","content_hash":"2a086ddf12e50d423d28ca297eb387d978999fb7b927f9d5c9968302bf755443","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-04T00:44:44.993670+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}